  "published": "2026-06-11T17:53:57.613Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "RadixSort now supports Half keys on WebGL (all key types sort on every browser backend). Fixed a cross-backend sub-word signed-reinterpret sign-extension bug that broke ExtractRadixBits<Half> for negative values on WebGPU/WebGL/Wasm. WebGL in-kernel group scan/reduce (GroupExtensions.ExclusiveScan/InclusiveScan/AllReduce) now throw UnsupportedKernelFeatureException instead of silently returning 0 (use the host CreateScan/CreateReduce). New CopyFromStreamAsync streams a .NET Stream into a GPU buffer in chunks, zero-copy on the browser backends when the source is an IJSReadStream. New MemoryPressure.AllocateWithReclaim pressure-aware allocation helper. Full per-version history with code samples: see CHANGELOG.md at https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
